    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "my 14 month old has had really bad diarrhea all day and he's super sleepy and won't really wake up to play. he also hasn't had a wet diaper in like 8 hours now. i'm worried... can i just give him some diluted apple juice to help him stay hydrated or do i really need to go to the ER?",
