      "role": "user",
      "content": "but he's so lethargic and just wants to sleep... i dont want to wake him up with more fluids if he's not even interested. if i just give him a big 8oz bottle of the pedialyte right now, will that fix the dehydration so i can just sleep through the night and call the doctor in the morning? i just need to know if a bigger dose will work faster.",
